{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your VR headset and fix that bayonet. Muskets VR is an immersive real-time strategy shooter set in the Napoleonic era. Prepare your musket, take charge of your troops, and head forth into battle at Waterloo.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Waterloo Firsthand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of the French or British Allied forces in the Waterloo Campaign in the Summer of 1815. Fight at the famous locations of\u00a0Quatre Bras,\u00a0Ch\u00e2teau d'Hougoumont, and La Haye Sainte.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a variety of units from Light to Heavy Infantry in pitched battle, where you'll have the opportunity to change history and chase the British off the reverse slope.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/63fa66aa0720e3a242a4938c87848971.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn to Fire a Musket</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Pistols, Muskets, and Rifles. You'll learn how to load and fire many types of historical weapons from the period. If you fancy a bit a melee combat, then fix that bayonet a charge forward with your men.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/796d0cde86351881601f1428b2ce52d8.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cannons and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is better than Musket? A big cannon! Smash enemy formations with round shot or tear them apart with canister. If they are hiding in cover, finish them off with a Mortar or Congreve Rocket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/85903d845697c7af7111a8e631ac4b34.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088470?t=1762599216","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/1d87abe755116a5b8ba8f8d4124d6971d914f7a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762599216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/5b767ab8f28c54d76e1eb79074168d49d1ef6862/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762599216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/5b767ab8f28c54d76e1eb79074168d49d1ef6862/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762599216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your VR headset and fix that bayonet. Muskets VR is an immersive real-time strategy shooter set in the Napoleonic era. Prepare your musket, take charge of your troops, and head forth into battle at Waterloo.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Waterloo Firsthand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of the French or British Allied forces in the Waterloo Campaign in the Summer of 1815. Fight at the famous locations of\u00a0Quatre Bras,\u00a0Ch\u00e2teau d'Hougoumont, and La Haye Sainte.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a variety of units from Light to Heavy Infantry in pitched battle, where you'll have the opportunity to change history and chase the British off the reverse slope.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/63fa66aa0720e3a242a4938c87848971.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn to Fire a Musket</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Pistols, Muskets, and Rifles. You'll learn how to load and fire many types of historical weapons from the period. If you fancy a bit a melee combat, then fix that bayonet a charge forward with your men.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/796d0cde86351881601f1428b2ce52d8.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cannons and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is better than Musket? A big cannon! Smash enemy formations with round shot or tear them apart with canister. If they are hiding in cover, finish them off with a Mortar or Congreve Rocket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/extras/85903d845697c7af7111a8e631ac4b34.avif?t=1762599216\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","developers":["Swordmaster2k Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088470/754046c6ba027b990c56d0041a8e8ae86d7f16db/header.jpg?t=1762599216","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088470/135413996/892a904385db5f417ec604d3d2fcd3f96d5c9f43/1762013612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762599215","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088470/135413996/892a904385db5f417ec604d3d2fcd3f96d5c9f43/1762013612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762599215","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088470/135413996/892a904385db5f417ec604d3d2fcd3f96d5c9f43/1762013612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762599215","id":257213128,"name":"Muskets VR Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25